    <!-- About Sections -->
    <section class="section" id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <!-- Built for Traction -->
            <div class="about-section about-section--light">
                <div class="about-section__grid">
                    <div class="about-section__content">
                        <h3>Built for <span>Traction</span></h3>
                        <p>Mach Five Group is a multidisciplinary engine built to move ideas from concept to traction. Under our umbrella, we operate several focused brands, each specialized in a different stage of the journey. From technical architecture to brand storytelling to design systems that scale. Together, they form a modular support network designed to accelerate ambitious teams and sharpen early momentum.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="masonry-grid">
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Technical Excellence</h4>
                            <p>Battle-tested architectures that scale with your growth</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Rapid Prototyping</h4>
                            <p>From concept to MVP in weeks, not months</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Modular Systems</h4>
                            <p>Reusable components and patterns for consistent delivery</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Cross-Discipline Teams</h4>
                            <p>Engineers, designers, and strategists working as one</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Growth Infrastructure</h4>
                            <p>Built to support 10x scale from day one</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Embedded for Impact -->
            <div class="about-section about-section--dark">
                <div class="about-section__grid about-section__grid--reverse">
                    <div class="about-section__content">
                        <h3>Embedded for <span class="brand-blue">Impact</span></h3>
                        <p>We engage where speed matters and the stakes are high. Whether stabilizing products, untangling infrastructure, or turning stalled initiatives into sustainable platforms, our approach is embedded, outcome-driven, and shaped by a long view. We don't just ship and step away. We invest attention, insight, and capability into the kinds of problems worth solving.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="masonry-grid">
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Deep Integration</h4>
                            <p>We become part of your team, not just another vendor</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Outcome Focused</h4>
                            <p>Success metrics defined upfront and delivered consistently</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Long-term Vision</h4>
                            <p>Solutions designed for tomorrow's challenges, not just today's</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Knowledge Transfer</h4>
                            <p>Your team learns and grows alongside our engagement</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Sustainable Platforms</h4>
                            <p>Building foundations that last beyond our involvement</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Not a Handshake. A Stake. -->
            <div class="about-section about-section--light">
                <div class="about-section__grid">
                    <div class="about-section__content">
                        <h3>Not a Handshake. <span class="text-gray">A Stake.</span></h3>
                        <p>In some cases, our involvement goes deeper. When there's alignment on vision and potential, we commit as more than a vendor, bringing our tools, systems, and focus to help shape both the product and the path forward. These are not short engagements. They're collaborations built on trust, shared stakes, and a mutual drive to see the work win.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="masonry-grid">
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Equity Partnerships</h4>
                            <p>Aligned incentives through shared ownership</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Strategic Advisory</h4>
                            <p>Board-level guidance on product and go-to-market</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Resource Commitment</h4>
                            <p>Our best people dedicated to your success</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Network Access</h4>
                            <p>Connections to investors, partners, and customers</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="masonry-item">
                            <h4>Shared Vision</h4>
                            <p>True partnership means winning together</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
