            </div>
            


            <div class="engagement-details">
                <div class="engagement-detail">
                    <h3>For Early-Stage Teams</h3>
                    <p>We help you move from idea to MVP with strategic planning, technical architecture, and rapid prototyping. Our Lead Magnet™ and conversion tools give you immediate traction while we build your foundation.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Product roadmapping and technical planning</li>
                        <li>MVP development and rapid iteration</li>
                        <li>Marketing automation and lead capture setup</li>
                        <li>Growth infrastructure that scales</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="engagement-detail">
                    <h3>For Growth-Stage Companies</h3>
                    <p>When velocity matters most, we embed senior engineers and marketers who take ownership and deliver results. From refactoring technical debt to scaling marketing operations, we're built for high-stakes execution.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Embedded technical leadership and mentoring</li>
                        <li>Performance marketing and SEO campaigns</li>
                        <li>System refactoring and optimization</li>
                        <li>DevOps and quality culture implementation</li>
