                        <li>Full-stack ownership from tech to marketing</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Philosophy - Keep dark for contrast -->
    <section class="section philosophy" id="philosophy">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="philosophy__content">
                <h2 class="philosophy__title">Mach Five Philosophy</h2>
                <p class="philosophy__text">
                    Lasting software should be <strong>resilient</strong>, <strong>scalable</strong>, and <strong>meaningful</strong>, not just trendy. That's why we avoid flavor-of-the-month frameworks and bleeding-edge distractions in favor of battle-tested technologies and design systems that scale. Our approach balances <strong>speed with intent</strong>, focusing on implementation strategies that stand up to real-world use without tying you to any single platform or fad.
                </p>
                <p class="philosophy__text">
                    We don't waste time with stacks of half-designed wireframes and idle ideas. Instead, we prototype early using <strong>functional MVPs</strong> and proofs of concept built from reusable components in our own tools and widget library. These are real working builds with minimal throwaway code, designed to help you <strong>test</strong>, <strong>iterate</strong>, and <strong>launch quickly</strong>. We understand the business side of product development and focus on delivering functional, usable software that gets you to market faster with quality you can trust.
                </p>
                
                <!-- Metrics Grid -->
                <div class="engagement-metrics">
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <div class="metric-value">48hr</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">Response Time</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <div class="metric-value">2-4</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">Weeks to MVP</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <div class="metric-value">100%</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">Code Ownership</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <div class="metric-value">3-12</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">Month Engagements</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

